      {
        "id": "1777",
        "name": "HELP_TEXT_PACK_1",
        "text": "HOW DO UNIT PACKS WORK?\n\n1. You will get one unit for every pack you buy.\n2. All packs give you the chance of winning all kind of creatures.\n3.The better the pack, the more chances to get a special unit (dragon, elite ,etc).\n4. The more packs you buy together, the better units will be won.\n5. The carousel of units is a visual representation, since all units are included in all packs.\n6. All units will go automatically to your storage."
      },
