        "id": "1865",
        "name": "SPELLBOOK_TITLE",
        "text": "Wizard's guide"
      },
      {
        "id": "1866",
        "name": "SPELLBOOK_EXPLANATION",
        "text": "1. Click on the 'Buy' button to learn a spell.\n\n2. Go to the battlefield and chose a spell to\ncast. if you have more than 3 spells available,\nclick on the yellow arrows at the sides to browse them.\n\n3. Move the area-of-effect grid over a unit, enemy or building to unleash the power of spell!\n\nTips:\nAll spells use mana. You can change cash for mana clicking on the Mana button. You can also buy mana with gold.\nAll spells have three levels of power (stars). The more you use the spells, the more the progress bar will fill out until reaching a new level of power."
      },
